---
description: VeloxLane brand tokens (apply to UI work)
globs: apps/web/**, apps/admin/**, apps/mobile/**, packages/ui/**, packages/brand/**
---
- Colors: Midnight #0A1628 (canvas/trust), Amber #E8A03D (ACCENTS ONLY — CTAs,
  the X, lane stripes, verified/escrow signals; never body text or full bg),
  Cream #F8F6F1 (backgrounds), Asphalt #3D4550 (secondary text),
  Signal Teal #2DBFA6 (verified/protected/escrow indicators).
- Type: Inter 600 italic, letter-spacing -0.03em for display; Inter 400 body.
- Voice: direct, warm, confident, specific. Tagline anchor: "Skip the lot. Take the lane."
- UX: one primary action per screen; trust badges visible; thumb-zone CTAs on mobile;
  errors are plain-language and recoverable, never raw codes.
